1
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:27,260
No one can stand before God’s throne

2
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:33,250
By keeping rules or deeds we’ve shown

3
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:38,980
God’s holy word reveals our blame

4
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:45,250
No work we do can cleanse our shame

5
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:51,720
We all have failed and gone astray

6
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:57,100
We all fall short of God’s glory and way

7
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:02,580
By grace alone, through faith we’re saved

8
00:01:02,610 --> 00:01:08,440
In Christ our hope, no more enslaved

9
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:13,640
It was His blood, God’s wrath appeased

10
00:01:14,130 --> 00:01:20,110
The price He paid, our souls released

11
00:01:20,110 --> 00:01:30,350
By grace alone, this we believe

12
00:01:37,420 --> 00:01:43,200
Upon the cross, God’s wrath was poured

13
00:01:43,250 --> 00:01:48,920
Its burning force Christ bravely bore

14
00:01:48,940 --> 00:01:54,400
He drank the cup that we deserved

15
00:01:54,630 --> 00:02:00,570
Soaked up the fury our sins had earned

16
00:02:01,290 --> 00:02:07,040
The cross displayed what justice cost

17
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:12,600
Yet grace is free to those who're lost

18
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:17,920
By grace alone, through faith we’re saved

19
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:23,830
In Christ our hope, no more enslaved

20
00:02:23,830 --> 00:02:29,500
It was His blood, God’s wrath appeased

21
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:35,510
The price He paid, our souls released

22
00:02:35,510 --> 00:02:45,920
By grace alone, this we believe

23
00:02:47,670 --> 00:02:53,530
My sin, my debt, His gift, His grace

24
00:02:53,540 --> 00:02:59,490
Christ shed His blood, He took my place

25
00:02:59,490 --> 00:03:05,210
His life, His death, His work complete

26
00:03:05,230 --> 00:03:14,680
There at the cross justice and mercy meet

27
00:03:15,890 --> 00:03:21,990
By grace alone, through faith we’re saved

28
00:03:21,990 --> 00:03:27,800
In Christ our hope, no more enslaved

29
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:33,080
It was His blood, God’s wrath appeased

30
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:39,530
The price He paid, our souls released

31
00:03:39,530 --> 00:03:44,860
By grace alone

32
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:50,640
Through faith alone

33
00:03:50,840 --> 00:04:00,160
In Christ alone

34
00:04:01,460 --> 00:04:08,790
That's how we are saved
